   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">given the following df:<div><br></div><div>toy_df &lt;- data.frame(City = c(&quot;Little Rock&quot;, &quot;Chicago&quot;, &quot;Toledo&quot;), State = c(&quot;Arkansas&quot;, &quot;Illinois&quot;, &quot;Ohio&quot;))<br></div><div><br></div><div>if I wanted to rename the variables in a batch using a function (eg <font face=\"courier new, monospace\">tolower()</font>) , how could I do this?</div><div><br></div><div>obviously, it&#39;s trivial to do so for the toy, but I need a generalizable way for a df with n variables.</div><div><br></div><div>Thank you.</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
